  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced.<br>• Finely chop brown onion. <br>• Finely chop garlic.<br>• Pick thyme leaves.<br>• Trim green beans, then roughly chop.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f857cfcade9b9f0ace631d/step-5672bb00.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• In a large frying pan, heat half the butter with a <br>drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.<br>• Cook onion, stirring, until softened, 5 minutes.<br>• Add garlic and thyme and cook until fragrant, <br>1 minute.<br>• Add risotto-style rice, stirring to coat. <br>• Add the water and vegetable stock. Bring to <br>the boil. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f857cfcade9b9f0ace631d/step-94ceaf10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Transfer risotto mixture to a baking dish. Cover <br>tightly with foil, then bake for 20 minutes.<br>• Remove risotto from oven. Stir through green <br>beans and a splash of water.<br>• Re-cover with foil, then bake until liquid is <br>absorbed, beans are tender and rice is ‘al dente’, <br>a further 5-8 minutes. </p> <p><br>TIP: ‘Al dente’ rice is cooked through but still slightly <br>firm in the centre. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f857cfcade9b9f0ace631d/step-1f623d20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Meanwhile, slice lemon into wedges.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f857cfcade9b9f0ace631d/step-e0431d30.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• When the risotto is ready, stir through half the <br>Parmesan cheese, basil pesto, a squeeze of <br>lemon juice and remaining butter.<br>• Stir through baby spinach leaves until wilted. <br>Season with salt and pepper to taste. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f857cfcade9b9f0ace631d/step-727b9c40.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Divide basil pesto and veggie risotto between <br>bowls. Sprinkle with remaining Parmesan and a<br>pinch of chilli flakes (if using).<br>• Serve with any remaining lemon wedges. Enjoy! </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f857cfcade9b9f0ace631d/step-3e8b2350.jpg"
    }
  ]
